---
# OpSy's checks, less one:
#
# - readability-identifier-length: the numerics here write their formulas in
#   the notation of the literature they come from (a, b, d, e of the
#   Householder and QL steps, q and v of Hamilton's products); longer names
#   would make the code harder to hold against its source.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-identifier-length
...
